# Client seed payloads carry engagement terms, pricing and personnel data,
# which MSA-style confidentiality clauses make Client Confidential Information.
# This repo is PUBLIC. Only the template is shareable.
scripts/clients/*.json
!scripts/clients/_TEMPLATE.json
